\newlabel{fig:safety-boundary}{{4}{11}{Accuracy and calibration as transport bias increased. Horizontal dotted lines show profiles-only performance; dashed lines show nominal 95\% coverage. The safety of robust borrowing depended strongly on the generating biology}{figure.caption.9}{}}
